msgid ""
"Pro is built for professionals who depend on staying informed. Every feed in your account is fetched every "
"5-15 minutes, meaning you see breaking news and updates as they happen. Regex classifiers let you build "
"precise filters that match patterns across titles, story text, and URLs. If your work depends on being the "
"first to know, Pro pays for itself."
